# D810G Rules Listing Demo
Output docs/assets/recordings/rules.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 900
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20

Type "# D810G — 60 MBA Rules with Z3 Verification"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "cd /Users/nongjiawu/playground/research/re-plugins/D810G"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "PYTHONPATH=python python -m d810g_engine cli rules"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 2s
